  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(14, 60, 16)\n\n(12, 40, 8)\n\n**Logic:** Second no. = [(First no. + Third no.) × 2]\n\n**(14, 60, 16) →**\n\n⇒ [(14 + 16) × 2]\n\n⇒ (30 × 2) = 60\n\n**(12, 40, 8) →**\n\n⇒ [(12 + 8) × 2]\n\n⇒ (20 × 2) = 40\n\nChecking all the given options:\n\n**1. (19, 80, 21) →**\n\n⇒ [(19 + 21) × 2]\n\n⇒ (40 × 2) = **80**\n\n**2.** (15, 45, 30) →\n\n⇒ [(15 + 30) × 2]\n\n⇒ (45 × 2) = 90\n\n**3. **(25, 120, 15) →\n\n⇒ [(25 + 15) × 2]\n\n⇒ (40 × 2) = 80\n\n**4. **(20, 30, 40) →\n\n⇒ [(20 + 40) × 2]\n\n⇒ (60 × 2) = 120\n\nHere, (19, 80, 21) shows a similar relation to the given set of numbers.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option (1)\".",
